$ oikade set secret/api-key
Error: oikade set takes a capability's ref and its value, and a secret is one of your values now
Usage:
  oikade set device/DEVICE/CAPABILITY VALUE [--json]
Hint: your values, passwords included, go in .env beside go.mod: your code reads each with oikade.Var, and oikade deploy sends them
exit 2

$ oikade set desk-plug on true
Error: oikade set takes a capability's ref and its value
Usage:
  oikade set device/DEVICE/CAPABILITY VALUE [--json]
Hint: oikade set device/desk-plug/on true
exit 2

$ oikade set device/desk-plug/on
Error: oikade set takes a capability's ref and its value
